// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - McIntosh 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3130224868" "<color orange>You find what remains of Sergeant McIntosh - it seems the Destroyers did everything they could to make sure he would not get out of here alive.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P910611254" "(Search McIntosh for anything useful)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2664874506" "<color orange>You're able to find a small device, which, when activated, plays a small voice message from McIntosh.</color><br><br>Think I've been digging too deep in this. They pulled me off my investigation when I found out about Mr. Fixadine, don't know why. They assigned it to someone from Imperial, <color yellow>Sergeant Reynolds</color>.<br><br>I disguised my visit to the lab as an inspection - I'm planning on hiding the evidence I've got on Mr. Fixadine's location in the lab. They'll search my office for sure, but they'll never think of looking in the lab."
// Answer Text :
"P918986055" "Looks like I'm in the right place."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1161890404" "<color orange>Time to find where that information was hidden.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Arvin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3133924230" "Yes? How can I help you today?"
// Answer Text :
"P1143948096" "I heard you're working on a cure for Fixadine."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P353945706" "A cure for Fixadine? Yes, yes I am.<br><br>What about it?"
// Answer Text :
"P2831772949" "I've got some spare Fixadine here. You can have it - for a price."
// Answer Text :
"P2860274982" "I have some Fixadine here. Take it for your research."
// Page Price Text :
"P3789668623" ""Sorry friend, but I have no money that I can use for buying the syringes. I just spent my last savings on the new lab to just get<i>started</i> on this research."
// Answer Text :
"P577098305" "Well, your loss then."
// Answer Text :
"P786566566" "Alright, here, you can have it on the house."
// Page Free Text :
"P1418801866" "Excellent!<br><br>This will help me move one step further in discovering the true cure for Fixadine addiction.<br><br>I don't think I'll ask <i>where</i> exactly you got this, but I'm happy to have it. Have a great day, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P982351713" "Take it easy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1310768250" "This Mr. Fixadine is a mysterious guy, but my boys figure that he's had a run in with the good men and women of the PPD.<br><br>I mean, if the guy is in charge of <i>all</i> the Fixadine in Nova, he's gotta have some sort of rap sheet. Maybe almost as big as mine!<br><br>But again, we've got ourselves a problem that involves getting that information. Which is why it's a good thing we got ourselves a 'respected' member of the Powers Division in our folds, eh?<br><br>Our boys say that one <color yellow>Sergeant McIntosh</color> should have some knowledge about Mr. Fixadine. From what they said, this McIntosh has been doing some investigations himself into the location of Mr. Fixadine. He's currently running an inspection on some random lab now - full of scientist types and all that stuff."
// AcceptString :
"P9852869" "I'm guessing it's up to me to talk to him and find out what he knows."
// SendOffString :
"P2687382035" "Yeah, exactly.<br><br>Now, I don't think this'll be too hard, you know? Fact of the matter is that this is just one guy, going into a place full of scientists - during their offtime even! If there was anything easier you might fall asleep."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3295321250" "Question Sergeant McIntosh"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P138084251" "You talk to that McIntosh guy yet?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4246947267" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: How All Tours Should End</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3446321021" "This plan is going to be anything but easy. Once more you enter an area with smoke hanging in the air.<br><br>Looks like the Destroyers got here first - with the intent to kill McIntosh!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4149840028" "We take down that guy?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1623914771" "Got ourselves some intereference, huh?!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1964768096" "He's done for, just gotta make sure to clean up any evidence he left behind."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3483115847" "Who gave us the tip off about this guy?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2517925940" "Looks like we might to have ourselves some FUN!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P184379517" "Dunno, just heard that someone sent us the word he was getting close to Mr. Fixadine."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P457173631" "Powers Division huh?! We'll send your head to White!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2199063252" "This'll send a message to White, he'll know exactly what he's dealing with now!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3052654961" "He'll think twice before crossing us now, that's for sure."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P952932905" "Sergeant McIntosh"

