// Dialog :
"P442814914" "So, that PPD guy bit the dust? Good for us, one less guy on the field to cause us trouble.<br><br>I'll send some of my crew out to these locations. If this guy was right, one of 'em is gonna lead us straight to Mr. Fixadine - and his stash!"

