// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - JackHammer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1398410420" "Hey {HeroName}, what happened? Where's the stash?<br><br>You got Mr. Fixadine, right? What's going on?"
// Answer Text :
"P171735065" "Mr. Fixadine is just another link in the chain. He's not behind all this."
// Page SoldtoArvin Text :
"P2570862832" "What?! He's not the source?! What did we do all that work for?! You ain't lying to me, are you, {HeroName}?<br><br>'Cause guess what I just found out from Tunnel Rat? Seems like <i>Dr. Arvin</i> 'mysteriously' got himself some Fixadine.<br><br>From <i>you</i>. You wanna explain what's up with that? Why you were holding out on me? I offered you good money for that crush, and you just gave it away to Arvin!"
// Answer Text :
"P2855274176" "Arvin was the better choice. He's actually doing something with it."
// Answer Text :
"P299077555" "You're just an addict, Jack. I'm not fueling your addiction."
// Page ArvinBetter Text :
"P1274008083" "Doing something with it?!<br><br>I'm DOING something with the crush too, {HeroName}, I'm using it to motivate these people down here!<br><br>You got some nerve givin' it to Arvin when WE need it to help win this war of ours.<br><br>But whatever, I'm just gonna keep this whole little deal in the back of my mind, yeah? So why don't you just back off and give me some space.<br><br>We'll figure out what to do next, since this guy wasn't our big ticket out."
// Answer Text :
"P3330739927" "Alright then."
// Page JustanAddict Text :
"P1358148042" "I ain't addicted to the stuff, {HeroName}. You hear me?! I got complete control over this thing!<br><br><i>I</i> use the stuff, I control it, I COMMAND it!<br><br>You got no right tryin' to decide whether or not I don't need it!<br><br>Just back off of me, I need some time to calm down, figure this stuff out, what we're gonna do next. Got a lot of people relying on us to get this stuff, and I ain't gonna just let this stop us."
// Page PaidJack Text :
"P3568004716" "Part of me kinda wonders if you sold off the stuff you found, {HeroName}, given that whole little deal that went down earlier with you and me.<br><br>I kinda wonder, would you take all the stash for yourself and sell it to the PPD?<br><br>To regular citizens? To the Destroyers?<br><br>Just in order to make a profit?"
// Answer Text :
"P2199212079" "I wouldn't do that, Jack. Nothing was there. -Nothing-"
// Answer Text :
"P1841006872" "We'll never know what I would've done, because nothing was there."
// Answer Text :
"P3696618109" "That depends on how much they were offering. But nothing was there for me to sell."
// Page NothingWasThere Text :
"P4124286422" "Alright... maybe that's right, maybe I'm just getting a bit ahead of myself. Just give me a sec to figure things out, get some of my crew ready for our next move."
// Page NeverKnow Text :
"P810567838" "Yeah... guess we'll never know, huh?<br><br>Look, {HeroName}, I might not trust you too much, but I'm gonna still need your help on finishing this up. Talk with me in a bit, I'm gonna get some of the boys ready for our next move."
// Page HowMuch Text :
"P1503934689" "You're lucky I need yor help, {HeroName}, or else I'd throw down with you here and now.<br><br>Things go south again, I might not be so nice about just forgettin' all this and moving forward, yeah?<br><br>So why don't you just back off and let me figure things out for a bit?"
// Answer Text :
"P1595236552" "Someone's a little touchy. I'll be back."
// Page GaveJack Text :
"P1247223032" "Man... this isn't good, {HeroName}. I thought we had everything figured out.<br><br><color orange>Jack Hammer injects himself with some Fixadine, letting out a relaxed sigh.</color><br><br>Ahhh...ahh...YEAH! Alright! We GOT this, {HeroName}.<br><br>You give me a few minutes... and I'm gonna RALLY up our boys... and we're gonna move this thing forward and take down all those smarmy Praetors on topside!"
// Answer Text :
"P802914816" "Let me know what's going to happen."
// Page Nothing Text :
"P3077668700" "Hrm... that's not good. So we're still in for a little more work, eh? That's fine, that's fine.<br><br>If Mr. Fixadine gave us the right info, then all we gotta do is track down the location of this place, get in there, and get out. Simple stuff, right?<br><br>Give me a bit to get things together, then we'll get a plan goin'."
// Answer Text :
"P2548603023" "Alright Jack"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2694421955" "Alright, {HeroName}, my crew found where Mr. Fixadine is operating.<br><br>Guy is a clever piece of work. He moves his operation through the tunnels and up into various warehouses in Nova, never stays in more than one place for too long. Must be why the PPD haven't been able to find him.<br><br>Only problem here is that, from what they say, Mr. Fixadine has got a <i>ton</i> of Destroyers in his little entourage. Must be easy keeping them all on a leash when you control the flow of the stuff. Man, just thinkin' about it...<br><br>Look, it's gonna be up to you to get to that warehouse and grab Mr. Fixadine and his stash. We control Mr. 'Fix', we control the stash, meanin' we control the Destroyers. This here is a big moment for us, {HeroName}, and you're gonna be the person who is at the front of it all!<br><br><color orange>If Mr. Fixadine really does control the entire stash, there's nothing stopping you from just... taking control of it for <i>yourself</i>, instead of for the Resistance...</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3792946442" "Leave it to me, Jack. I'll get it done."
// SendOffString :
"P908203125" "That's what I like about you, {HeroName}, you're all about getting things DONE!<br><br>When you got the stash and Mr. Fix, drag him back to me and we'll figure out what our next move is gonna be.<br><br>Like I said though, be careful, this place is gonna be crawling with Destroyers. No way of telling what you're gonna run into when you arrive."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1250668417" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Mr. Fixadine, Sing Me a Song</color>"

